@startuml
actor 教师
participant "前端页面" as Frontend
participant "ExamController" as Controller
participant "ExamService" as Service
participant "ExamMapper" as Mapper
participant "数据库" as DB

教师 -> Frontend: 输入考试信息并提交
Frontend -> Controller: POST /exam/add
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: save(exam)
activate Service
Service -> Mapper: insert(exam)
activate Mapper
Mapper -> DB: 插入考试信息
activate DB
DB --> Mapper: 操作结果
deactivate DB
Mapper --> Service: 操作结果
deactivate Mapper
Service --> Controller: 保存成功
deactivate Service
Controller --> Frontend: 返回成功响应
deactivate Controller
@enduml